# Hoist the Jelly, Roger (windurst 51), completion parity: 10001's finish is the Lua's raw player:completeQuest (then
# the Super Soup Pot, the fame, the jelly), so a GM's Quest[2][51]Prog survives the completion (quest:cleanup, which a
# called Quest.Complete() runs, would clear it). Accepted (GM) beside Maysoon.
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-105.5,-2.0,69.6 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.HoistTheJellyRoger accepted
item ServingOfRoyalJelly
login
charvar Quest[2][51]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trade Maysoon ServingOfRoyalJelly x1    # one jelly: 10001
finish                                  # completed; the Super Soup Pot; fame 40; the jelly taken; Prog kept
